1
00:00:00,775 --> 00:00:03,565
(Leonard:)- ...but she did kind of betray you.
- lnteresting.

2
00:00:03,736 --> 00:00:08,036
(Sheldon:)You see betrayal in others
but not yourseIf.

3
00:00:09,492 --> 00:00:12,412
(Leonard:)Going to Wheaton's party
is not betraying you.

4
00:00:12,578 --> 00:00:16,668
(Sheldon:)Of course, you would have to believe that.
Evil always thinks it's doing right.

5
00:00:16,833 --> 00:00:17,873
(Leonard:)Huh.

6
00:00:18,042 --> 00:00:21,922
(Sheldon:)Excuse me, Stormtrooper.
These are the droids you're looking for.

7
00:00:23,297 --> 00:00:24,877
(Leonard:)I'm going to a party.

8
00:00:25,049 --> 00:00:29,469
(Leonard:)I'm not turning R2-D2
and C-3PO over to the Empire!

9
00:00:31,973 --> 00:00:33,263
(Sheldon:)Not yet.

10
00:00:34,809 --> 00:00:37,769
What's gonna happen? Are you
and Bernadette gonna break up?

11
00:00:37,937 --> 00:00:41,317
(Howard:)If we're going to get back together,
she's gonna have to apologize...

12
00:00:41,482 --> 00:00:45,902
(Howard:)...and accept that I'm a grown man
who can make his own decisions.

13
00:00:46,070 --> 00:00:48,660
Then convince your mother
to let you go into space.

14
00:00:48,823 --> 00:00:50,073
(Howard:)Obviously.

15
00:00:53,661 --> 00:00:56,541
(Bernadette:)I had no choice.
I had to tell his mother.

16
00:00:56,706 --> 00:00:59,416
(Bernadette:)He can't go to space.

17
00:00:59,584 --> 00:01:03,024
(Bernadette:)He's like a baby bird.

